# INVWINSB.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the serial
# number and the filters.  Search > Find serial number opens the search
# dialog on the serial number, which finds its item; ESC opens the
# dialog again there, its value kept, and its ESC the item list.
# Search > Filter items opens it on the category, where OK with no value
# is refused, the focus staying there.  A category chosen by its letter
# lists its items, and so does a location alone, with all below
# the items of the locations inside it too, kept checked for the dialog
# shown again; the status D, chosen by its letter, lists none, the status A
# every item; and a text given with a filter searches among the items
# the filter keeps.  The end by Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINSB.SNP is
# its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-S S
S DIALOG
T HGC-0042
K ENTER
S SERIAL
K ESC
S AGAIN
K ESC
K ALT-S F
S FILTER
K ENTER
S EMPTY
T CC
K ENTER
S CAT
# each dialog again starts on the category, its text selected
K ESC HOME ALT-L
T a1
K ENTER
S LOC
# all below the location too: the drives in its box as well; ESC shows
# it still checked, and it is unchecked again
K ESC ALT-A SPACE ENTER
S BELOW
K ESC
S BELOWAGN
K ALT-A SPACE ENTER
K ESC ALT-L DEL ALT-S
T D
S STATD
K ENTER
S NONE
K ESC ALT-S
T A
K ENTER
S STATA
# TAB goes round from the location, all below, the status, available,
# the tags and the works state to the text
K ESC TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB
T Tandon
K ENTER
S TEXT
K ESC ESC
S ITEMS
K ALT-F X
